             <item>
              <widget class="QLabel" name="thresholds_tip_label">
               <property name="text">
                <string>&lt;b&gt;Fewer false positives&lt;/b&gt;, especially during spindles, alpha waves or beta bursts. Raise A first. You can also raise B and C, especially when the EMG channel is unstable or very sensitive.</string>
