        <item>
         <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="about_muscle_layout">
          <property name="spacing">
           <number>6</number>
          </property>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="about_muscle_title_label">
            <property name="font">
             <font>
              <bold>true</bold>
             </font>
            </property>
            <property name="text">
             <string>About the muscle artifact detector</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="about_muscle_label">
            <property name="text">
             <string>&lt;b&gt;How the power is computed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• The EEG is filtered at 0.3–30 Hz and downsampled to 64 Hz [1]. The filter is a Butterworth filter of order 6, applied forward and backward (no phase delay).&lt;br/&gt;• The power of the myogenic activity (20.25–32 Hz) is computed by integrating the power spectral density, estimated with Welch's method [2].&lt;br/&gt;• The power is computed on 4 s windows with a 2 s step, a finer time resolution than in [1].&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Thresholds (× the baseline median)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• The baseline is the 3 min around the window. The power of each window is compared to the median power of its baseline.&lt;br/&gt;• (A) High threshold on the EEG. A window is an artifact when its EEG power &amp;gt; A × the baseline median.&lt;br/&gt;• (B and C) With the EMG. A smaller increase on the EEG is also an artifact when the EMG increases too. A window is an artifact when its EMG power &amp;gt; B × the median of the EMG baseline and its EEG power &amp;gt; C × the baseline median.&lt;br/&gt;• The use of the EMG is new, not in the original publication [1].</string>
            </property>
            <property name="textFormat">
             <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="variant" stdset="0">
             <string notr="true">help</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
